{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperation. Looting.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of a ruined galaxy, laws no longer exist. The great factions have collapsed, giving way to cosmic chaos where only cunning, strength, and cooperation ensure survival. You play as a Void Raider, a space marauder with no ties, ready to do whatever it takes to get your hands on rare resources and forgotten artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutants born from uncontrolled experiments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens with unpredictable behavior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated guards or heavily armed soldiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 and much worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Choose your role, play as a team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player must choose a specialized role, purchasable in-game. Cooperate smartly to maximize your chances of survival:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bandit</strong>: armed with a pistol, the group\u2019s strike force, ready to engage in combat at the first sign of threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigator</strong>: equipped with a scanner, detects enemies, important objects, and traps before it\u2019s too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carrier</strong>: able to lift heavy objects with less penalty, essential for recovering bulky treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hacker</strong>: can hack systems, disable machines, and open doors requiring access cards or codes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or choose to remain a Raider</strong>: versatile, it has no special abilities but benefits from <strong>an additional inventory slot</strong>, ideal for carrying more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each role complements the others. Victory belongs to teams that communicate, adapt, and support each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan as a team</strong>: Up to 4 players can cooperate in the raid. Coordinate and survive together\u2014or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But beware</strong>: every expedition is a risk. If you fall, you lose everything\u2026 unless your teammates manage to make it out.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Begin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724750/a7a0d30397db801bd9c7b57deeab14626edac3e9.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724750/084255ae68eb1d4263dc87c3719de9b10b273679.jpg"},{"name":"Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724750/0919584e5c1f169e0569d2461f48fbf5962debae.jpg"},{"name":"Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724750/f2167946c07814ddea38ecfc0df0e501878c526f.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724750/c212b93dbce77ca857669ef520fccc480ecc0863.jpg"},{"name":"Execptional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724750/1e83c4853e029b29a01615db4177ff8cbb0a6a5e.jpg"},{"name":"Vermin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724750/d73f143a5edd0d919121b044568a83f917bff1d8.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724750/413ab1fc869eb0092b60901cf54d950b089633ff.jpg"},{"name":"Burn !!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724750/789628da46e31e3e764ebc82d0942ec2d46a63a5.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724750/84f4cfb5cb70b0f34c531063020c165c48219270.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724750?t=1761640471","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.s